\tag{fnip}
\title{Orbits near a hyperbolic equilibrium}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{Near a [hyperbolic](fnip-0034) [equilibrium](fnip-0014) the
linearization draws a [node](fnip-0035), a [saddle](fnip-0035), or a
[focus](fnip-0035). The nonlinear velocity is a different map.}

\p{How do the nonlinear orbits sit relative to those linear orbits, and
which curves through a saddle approach it or leave it?}

